---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Products — Sustainabox">

	<div class="page-header">
		<div class="container">
			<h1>Templates & Tools</h1>
			<p>Digital products to help you design, plan, and execute your project. Use independently or alongside the course.</p>
		</div>
	</div>

	<section class="container content-section">
		<div class="products">
			<div class="product">
				<h3>Cost Calculator</h3>
				<p><strong>$29</strong></p>
				<p>Detailed cost breakdown template for container homes and alternative housing.</p>
				<ul>
					<li>Materials (containers, structural, MEP, finishes)</li>
					<li>Labor estimates by trade</li>
					<li>Contingency planning (20–30% buffer)</li>
					<li>Real data from our build</li>
				</ul>
				<a href="https://gumroad.com/l/sustainabox-cost-calculator" class="btn btn-outline" target="_blank">Buy Now</a>
			</div>

			<div class="product">
				<h3>Project Planner</h3>
				<p><strong>$39</strong></p>
				<p>Timeline and milestone tracker for design through handoff.</p>
				<ul>
					<li>Phase breakdown (design, permits, procurement, build, finishes)</li>
					<li>Realistic durations and dependencies</li>
					<li>Milestone checklist</li>
					<li>Trade coordination notes</li>
				</ul>
				<a href="https://gumroad.com/l/sustainabox-project-planner" class="btn btn-outline" target="_blank">Buy Now</a>
			</div>

			<div class="product">
				<h3>Design Checklist</h3>
				<p><strong>$19</strong></p>
				<p>Comprehensive design and code compliance checklist.</p>
				<ul>
					<li>Site analysis questions</li>
					<li>Code compliance requirements by jurisdiction</li>
					<li>Safety and accessibility checks</li>
					<li>Systems coordination (electrical, plumbing, HVAC)</li>
				</ul>
				<a href="https://gumroad.com/l/sustainabox-design-checklist" class="btn btn-outline" target="_blank">Buy Now</a>
			</div>

			<div class="product bundle">
				<h3>Complete Bundle</h3>
				<p><strong>$79</strong> <span class="savings">(Save $8)</span></p>
				<p>All three templates, ready to customize for your project.</p>
				<ul>
					<li>Cost Calculator</li>
					<li>Project Planner</li>
					<li>Design Checklist</li>
					<li>Lifetime updates</li>
				</ul>
				<a href="https://gumroad.com/l/sustainabox-bundle" class="btn btn-primary" target="_blank">Buy Bundle</a>
			</div>
		</div>

		<p style="text-align: center; margin-top: 3rem; color: var(--color-muted);">All products are digital downloads. You'll receive them immediately after purchase.</p>
	</section>

</Layout>

<style>
	.page-header {
		background: var(--color-navy);
		color: white;
		padding: 4rem 0;
		text-align: center;
	}

	.page-header h1 {
		color: white;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}

	.page-header p {
		font-size: 1.1rem;
		opacity: 0.9;
	}

	.content-section {
		padding: 3rem 0;
	}

	.products {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
		gap: 2rem;
	}

	.product {
		background: var(--color-warm);
		padding: 2rem;
		border-radius: 8px;
		border-left: 4px solid var(--color-blue);
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
	}

	.product.bundle {
		border-left-color: var(--color-rust);
		background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-warm), rgba(192, 86, 33, 0.05));
	}

	.product h3 {
		color: var(--color-navy);
		margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
	}

	.product p:first-of-type {
		font-weight: 600;
		color: var(--color-blue);
		font-size: 1.2rem;
		margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
	}

	.product .savings {
		font-size: 0.8rem;
		color: var(--color-rust);
		font-weight: 600;
	}

	.product p {
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
		font-size: 0.95rem;
	}

	.product ul {
		list-style: none;
		padding: 0;
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
		flex-grow: 1;
	}

	.product li {
		padding: 0.4rem 0;
		padding-left: 1.25rem;
		position: relative;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		color: var(--color-muted);
	}

	.product li::before {
		content: "✓";
		position: absolute;
		left: 0;
		color: var(--color-blue);
		font-weight: 700;
	}

	.product .btn {
		align-self: flex-start;
	}
</style>
